flowchart LR
    R0[old root / 旧 root]
    C0[old children array]
    N0[old target node]
    R1[new root copy / 新 root 副本]
    C1[new children copy]
    N1[new target copy]
    SharedA[unchanged sibling A<br/>共享兄弟 A]
    SharedB[unchanged subtree B<br/>共享子树 B]

    R0 --> C0 --> N0
    C0 --> SharedA
    R0 --> SharedB
    R1 --> C1 --> N1
    C1 --> SharedA
    R1 --> SharedB
    N0 -. patch path copied .-> N1
